{
  "name": "How do I get to Santorini?",
  "parent_id": 230624347930176,
  "group_id": "49507412-9fd5-4e87-9570-26df678b4eb9",
  "alternates": [],
  "created_at": "2026-10-15T07:17:27.065Z",
  "deleted_at": null,
  "sort_by_date": null,
  "tag_list": [],
  "updated_at": "2026-11-10T21:06:11.301Z",
  "published_at": "2026-11-10T21:06:11.266Z",
  "id": 230846656809596,
  "uuid": "39e71b69-95dd-48a3-9035-273321b75cff",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "6f1c1c0e-3b0a-4d57-9a54-0a1d3b7f7a02",
    "answer": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Fly or take a ferry. Santorini airport sits near Fira and has frequent flights from Athens, which take about 45 minutes.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Ferries leave Piraeus, the port of Athens, and also connect from other Cyclades islands. Crossings from Piraeus take roughly 5 to 8 hours.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "question": "How do I get there?",
    "component": "faq_item",
    "answer__i18n__de": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Du kannst fliegen oder die Fähre nehmen. Der Flughafen von Santorin liegt in der Nähe von Fira und hat häufige Flüge ab Athen, die etwa 45 Minuten dauern.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Fähren fahren ab Piräus, dem Hafen von Athen, und verbinden Santorin auch mit anderen Kykladeninseln. Die Überfahrt ab Piräus dauert etwa 5 bis 8 Stunden.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "answer__i18n__es": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "En avión o en ferri. El aeropuerto de Santorini está cerca de Fira y tiene vuelos frecuentes desde Atenas, que duran unos 45 minutos.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Los ferris salen del Pireo, el puerto de Atenas, y también conectan con otras islas de las Cícladas. La travesía desde el Pireo dura entre 5 y 8 horas aproximadamente.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "answer__i18n__fr": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Prenez l'avion ou le ferry. L'aéroport de Santorin se trouve près de Fira et propose de fréquents vols depuis Athènes, d'une durée d'environ 45 minutes.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Les ferries partent du Pirée, le port d'Athènes, et relient aussi d'autres îles des Cyclades. La traversée depuis le Pirée dure environ 5 à 8 heures.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "question__i18n__de": "Wie komme ich dorthin?",
    "question__i18n__es": "¿Cómo llego?",
    "question__i18n__fr": "Comment s'y rendre ?"
  },
